    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d179-a7">

                <pb facs="0328" n="322" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg322"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Annex No</hi>. 5.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-02-13">February 13, 1901</date>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">IMPERIAL EDICT of the 13 February,
                        1901</hi>. (<hi rendition="#italic">Translation.</hi>)</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ch’i-hsiu</hi>, president of the Board of Rites, and
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hsü Cheng-yu</hi>, formerly senior
                    Vice-President of the Board of Punishments, are in the first place to be
                    degraded.</p>
                <p>We order Yi K’uang and Li Hung-chang to obtain exact proof of their guilt and to
                    send Us at once a report. They shall be punished with the greatest severity.</p>
                <p>Respect this!”</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#italic">Correct copy</hi>. <lb/><signed><list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. d’Anthouard</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">B. Kroupensky.</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reginald Tower</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. Bohlen-Halbach.</hi></item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
